    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "&lt;p&gt;Show starts at 8pm, Doors open at 7pm We are excited to host&nbsp;Rob Heath’s album release for&nbsp;Biggest Moments! Edmonton based singer/songwriter Rob Heath is first and foremost a storyteller. Rob’s new album is the best of the over 30+ songs he wrote and produced over the past year in his studio. All but one are produced, [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\n"
